    "fullContentHtml":  "\n\u003ch1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\"\u003eUP Board Class 10th, 12th Compartment Online Form 2026\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\"\u003ePost Date: \u003ctime class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-05T16:35:22+05:30\"\u003eJune 5, 2026\u003c/time\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cspan class=\"custom-post-time\"\u003e4:35 pm\u003c/span\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/up-board-result-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eUttar Pradesh Madhyamik Shiksha Parishad (UPMSP)\u003c/a\u003e,\u003c/strong\u003e has released a \u003cstrong\u003ecompartment form notice\u003c/strong\u003e on its \u003cstrong\u003eofficial website\u003c/strong\u003e for the examination of \u003cstrong\u003eclass 10 / 12th\u0026nbsp;2026.\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003eUPMSP \u003c/b\u003eCompartment Form has started on \u003cstrong\u003e06 June 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u0026amp; the candidates can apply until the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e27 June 2026\u003c/strong\u003e. Candidates must check the complete details for \u003cstrong\u003eUP Board Class 10th, 12th Compartment Online Form 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;which has given below.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\u003cdiv class=\"social-buttons\"\u003e\u003c!-- WhatsApp Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e WhatsApp \u003c/a\u003e \u003c!-- Telegram Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e Telegram \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\"\u003eUP Board Class 10th, 12th Compartment Online Form 2026 – Start\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\u003ch3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\"\u003eUP Board 10th / 12th Examination 2026 : Short Details\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/up-board-result-2026/\"\u003eSarkariResult.com.cm\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImportant Dates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eTime Table Issued : \u003cstrong\u003e05 November 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003eClass 10th High School Exam Date :\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e 18 February 2026 to 12 March 2026\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003eClass 12th Intermediate Exam Date :\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e 18 February 2026 to 12 March 2026\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eResult Declared Date : \u003cstrong\u003e23 April 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompartment Form Start Date : 06 June 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eLast Date : \u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e27 June 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApplication Fee\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eNA\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\"\u003e\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\"\u003eAge Limits \u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eNA\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\"\u003eNA\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\"\u003e\n\u003ch6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\"\u003eUP Board 10th / 12th Time Table 2026\u003c/h6\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;UP Board 10th / 12th Time Table 2026 : Examination Details\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUP Board High School Examination and Intermediate Examination, 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;UP Board 10th / 12th Time Table 2026 : Eligibility Criteria\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eStudents who are \u003cstrong\u003eenrolled in the UP Board Class 10th and 12th Examination 2026\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #800000;\"\u003eYou May Also Check :\u003c/span\u003e \u003ca href=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/railway-rrc-nwr-apprentice-recruitment-2024/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eRailway RRC NWR Apprentice Online Form 2025\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAccording to media reports, the \u003cstrong data-start=\"32\" data-end=\"81\"\u003eUP Board 10th and 12th practical examinations\u003c/strong\u003e will be conducted \u003cstrong data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"133\"\u003efrom January to February 2026\u003c/strong\u003e, while the \u003cstrong data-start=\"145\" data-end=\"168\"\u003etheory examinations\u003c/strong\u003e are expected to be held in \u003cstrong data-start=\"196\" data-end=\"213\"\u003eFebruary 2026\u003c/strong\u003e. However, the \u003cstrong data-start=\"228\" data-end=\"280\"\u003eboard has not yet made any official announcement\u003c/strong\u003e regarding this.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;How To Fill UP Board 10th / 12th Compartment Online Form 2026\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ui8njk\" data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"416\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eVisit the official UPMSP website.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ui8njk\" data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"416\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eClick on the \u003cstrong data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"172\"\u003eUP Board Class 10th / 12th Compartment Exam 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;application link.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ui8njk\" data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"416\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eRead the instructions and \u003cstrong\u003eeligibility criteria carefully.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ui8njk\" data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"416\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eEnter your Roll Number, \u003cstrong\u003epersonal details, and required academic information.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ui8njk\" data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"416\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eSelect the subject(s) for the compartment/improvement examination.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ui8njk\" data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"416\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eUpload the required documents, if applicable.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ui8njk\" data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"416\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003ePay the prescribed examination fee through the available payment method.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ui8njk\" data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"416\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eReview all entered details carefully before final submission.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ui8njk\" data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"416\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eSubmit the application form and download the confirmation page.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ui8njk\" data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"416\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eTake a printout of the completed application form and fee receipt for future reference.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp