50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDownload Time Table\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/UP-Board-Time-Table-2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #0000ff;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eClick Here\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOfficial Website\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://upmsp.edu.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #0000ff;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eClick Here\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;UP Board 10th / 12th Compartment Online Form 2026 : important questions\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e Has the \u003cstrong\u003eUP Board Result 2026\u003c/strong\u003e been released?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e Yes, the result has been \u003cstrong data-start=\"215\" data-end=\"238\"\u003eofficially declared\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion: How can students check the UP Board 10th / 12th Result 2026?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer: \u003c/strong\u003eStudents can check their result by visiting the official sarkari result page and entering their \u003cstrong data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"693\"\u003eRoll Code and Roll Number\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion: What are the passing marks for UP Board 10th / 12th Result 2026?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer: \u003c/strong\u003eStudents must secure \u003cstrong data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1257\"\u003eat least 33% marks in each subject\u003c/strong\u003e to pass the examination.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion: Is the online result mark sheet valid?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer: \u003c/strong\u003eThe online result is \u003cstrong data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1623\"\u003eprovisional\u003c/strong\u003e. Students must collect the \u003cstrong data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1692\"\u003eoriginal mark sheet from their school\u003c/strong\u003e later.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion: What is the official website Of UP Board?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer: \u003c/strong\u003eThe official website Of\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eUP Board\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;is\u003cstrong\u003e https://upmsp.edu.in/\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-36169 aligncenter\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-30-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"UP Board Class 10th, 12th Compartment Online Form 2026\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-30-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-30-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-30-768x432.jpg 768w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-30.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-ce6e23c9\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-a1cd0fe1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"gb-headline-text\"\u003eSarkari Result.Com.Cm\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003ctable sty